25
00:01:13.214 --> 00:01:16.400
Truly a manifesto on life transformation,

26
00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:19.490
this episode represents the detailed personal account

27
00:01:19.490 --> 00:01:23.050
of how Josh accomplished what many would deem impossible,

28
00:01:23.050 --> 00:01:25.380
