39
00:01:51.400 --> 00:01:53.240
So how did Josh do it?

40
00:01:53.240 --> 00:01:55.310
Well, you're gonna have to listen to find out.

41
00:01:55.310 --> 00:01:57.520
So here is Josh LaJaunie,

42
00:01:57.520 --> 00:02:01.563
in one of the most inspiring and heartwarming episodes,

43
00:02:01.563 --> 00:02:05.133
