126
00:05:50.215 --> 00:05:52.920
you know, the everyday dude,

127
00:05:52.920 --> 00:05:55.940
who no one's really looking at them.

128
00:05:55.940 --> 00:05:57.870
They're not in the public eye, or anything like that.

129
00:05:57.870 --> 00:05:59.050
