131
00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:03.920
People are always saying to me,

132
00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:06.730
you gotta have some average people on,

133
00:06:06.730 --> 00:06:09.620
have some normal dudes on the show,

134
00:06:09.620 --> 00:06:11.590
and let them tell their story, you know?

135
00:06:11.590 --> 00:06:14.240
