143
00:06:33.530 --> 00:06:38.530
and I just sorta almost kinda rode the wave on that alone.

144
00:06:39.050 --> 00:06:40.000
So hold on.

145
00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:42.361
So you grew up in the New Orleans area.

146
00:06:42.361 --> 00:06:43.550
Correct.

147
00:06:43.550 --> 00:06:45.950
I grew up in a small town called Thibodaux,

148
00:06:45.950 --> 00:06:48.310
which it's on the Bayou.

149
00:06:48.310 --> 00:06:52.001
I live in I'm, like, part of, I guess,

150
00:06:52.001 --> 00:06:56.020
the country knows about "Swamp People,"

151
00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:58.740
and all of the different deal.

152
00:06:58.740 --> 00:07:03.740
With our new Hollywood South sort of identity down here,

153
00:07:03.890 --> 00:07:07.486
a lot more people with all of the film trucks and crews,

154
00:07:07.486 --> 00:07:10.107
a lot more people know about who we are now

155
