156
00:07:13.220 --> 00:07:15.440
So you're like down there,

157
00:07:15.440 --> 00:07:17.570
like it's Creole country pretty much.

158
00:07:17.570 --> 00:07:20.703
Oh, man, yeah, no, we're coon-asses, bro.

159
00:07:23.067 --> 00:07:26.173
Creole is a little fancier than what we are.

160
00:07:27.535 --> 00:07:31.890
We are pure Cajuns, grew up fishing and hunting,

161
00:07:31.890 --> 00:07:33.809
and making, like I say,

162
00:07:33.809 --> 00:07:38.009
making roux and stews with anything that moves,

163
00:07:38.009 --> 00:07:40.200
that's what we grew up doing, man.

164
00:07:40.200 --> 00:07:41.033
Uh-huh, nice.

165
00:07:41.033 --> 00:07:42.840
And so you're playing football in high school?

166
00:07:42.840 --> 00:07:45.290
Yes, absolutely, I sure did.

167
00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:49.650
I played ball in high school, and in high school I was about

168
00:07:50.910 --> 00:07:54.730
6'3", 280-ish, 290-ish,

169
00:07:54.730 --> 00:07:57.119
and it got a little bit bigger every year.

170
00:07:57.119 --> 00:08:02.119
I got some looks in college in my senior year.

171
00:08:05.520 --> 00:08:08.463
The one college that was really interested in me

172
00:08:08.463 --> 00:08:11.700
