173
00:08:11.700 --> 00:08:14.070
They wanted me to switch over to the offensive line,

174
00:08:14.070 --> 00:08:15.510
which I had played defensive line

175
00:08:15.510 --> 00:08:18.160
throughout my whole high school career.

176
00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:19.173
And so I was like,

177
00:08:19.173 --> 00:08:22.760
I really wasn't pumped about playing O-line,

178
00:08:22.760 --> 00:08:26.011
but it was an opportunity for me,

179
00:08:26.011 --> 00:08:28.410
and they told me to put on some weight.

180
00:08:28.410 --> 00:08:29.940
They wanted me to put on some weight.

181
00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:33.410
So I get up there and I'm 330 now.

182
00:08:33.410 --> 00:08:35.600
I get up there and I go through my training camp.

183
00:08:35.600 --> 00:08:36.927
So you were 330,

184
00:08:36.927 --> 00:08:38.799
