627
00:28:07.770 --> 00:28:09.663
to all of the far-reaches of those veins

628
00:28:09.663 --> 00:28:12.730
as quickly as you can move now.

629
00:28:12.730 --> 00:28:15.251
And I was like, oh, okay, well, that all makes sense,

