00:28:23.880 --> 00:28:28.420
that Josh wasn't gonna hurt himself doing this,

634
00:28:28.420 --> 00:28:29.380
reaching out,

635
00:28:29.380 --> 00:28:33.530
and reaching out so far outside of what had been my box.

636
00:28:33.530 --> 00:28:34.364
Right, right.

