00:33:16.600 --> 00:33:19.590
I mean, the trickle down effect of just the stuff

731
00:33:19.590 --> 00:33:21.317
that you have to deal with on a daily basis,

732
00:33:21.317 --> 00:33:24.600
and the amount of energy output that it requires

