you have a finite amount of willpower, right?

752
00:34:10.454 --> 00:34:11.287
Right.

753
00:34:11.287 --> 00:34:12.410
And it's expended on just that.

754
00:34:12.410 --> 00:34:15.770
So to ask somebody to go above and beyond

