00:34:15.770 --> 00:34:18.780
to handle what seems like an obvious thing

756
00:34:18.780 --> 00:34:20.793
for somebody who doesn't have to deal with that

757
00:34:20.793 --> 00:34:23.622
is too much to bear.

758
00:34:23.622 --> 00:34:26.750
Right, yeah, I get it.

759
00:34:26.750 --> 00:34:31.470
Uh-huh, so, all right, so we're orbiting around

